Third-party components
======================

PROJ (https://proj.org/)
------------------------
This repository contains an unmodified source copy of PROJ 9.8.1 in
third_party/proj/.  PROJ is distributed under the MIT/X11 licence; see
third_party/proj/COPYING for the full text.

The baltic library links against PROJ and uses its `vgridshift` operation,
grid handling (GeoTIFF/GTX) and interpolation code.  Vertical grid data
(EGM2008) is not part of this repository; see data/README.md for sources and
terms of use.

EGM2008
-------
The EGM2008 Earth Gravitational Model was developed by the U.S. National
Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (NGA).  Grid files are redistributed by
several mirrors; consult data/README.md before downloading.

The compact C arrays in embedded/grids/ are derived from the EGM2008 grid
by the egm2008_to_c generator and are subject to the same terms as the
source model.
